data: {"type":"ready","document_id":"0d82c6c8fad24c659246d0b89203d9fe","name":"nova-i09-real-smoke-input.pdf","chunk_count":2,"document_summary":"Table 7 presents the outcomes for three experimental conditions. In experiment 0 the measured accuracy was 0.25 % with an associated cost of 0.75. Experiment 1 achieved an accuracy of 1.25 % at a cost of 1.75. Experiment 2 yielded an accuracy of 2.25 % with a cost of 2.75. The table records each of these measurements for the respective settings."}

